ong,\nThus thoughtful-souled Agastya, best\nOf hermits, with a smile addresed:\n'How, Ra'kshas, is the fiend empowered\nTo issue forth whom I devoured?\nThy brother in a ram’s disguise-\nIs gone where Yama’s kingdom lies.'
