5433	816	11	A Suvarmam or Kavala-graham is equal to one Karsha in weight. A Shuktim is equal to a half Palam or eight Mashakas in weight. A Vilvam, or Mushti is equal to a Palam weight. Two Palas make one Prasriti. Four Palas make one Anjali or Kudavam. Eight Palas make one Palam. Four Kudavas make one Prastha; four Prasthas make one Adakam or Kansapatrah. Four Adakas make one Drona. A hundred Palas make one Tula weight. Twenty Palas make one Bhara. The erudite ones have laid down these measures in respect of dry weight, while in respect of fluid weight these measures should be taken as double.
